oxidisc (2.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Major release 2.0.0.
  * Rebranded to OxiDisc.
  * Added Ratatui TUI and modern egui GUI.
  * Added pure-Rust native Windows CDDA ripper and DiscID support.
  * Added Opus audio output format support.
  * Added AcoustID acoustic audio fingerprinting via Chromaprint.
  * Added GnuDB (FreeDB) metadata provider and auto-cascade.

